      ]
    },
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Do This:\r\n\r\n1.  Move the slider to test the cases you wrote down. \r\n2.  Hack the code by making changes to the `script.js` file. Find the section labeled `Conditional Logic` and customize the colors, message, and more.\r\n3.  Try it out! Test the slider to see your changes take effect.",
